WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.901
&gt;&gt;&gt; WE'RE GETTING NEW
INFORMATION ABOUT THE VIOLENT

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:04.604
MURDERS OF FOUR COLLEGE STUDENTS
IN IDAHO.

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:08.875
DETECTIVES REVEALING THE INITIAL
9-1-1 CALL CAME FROM ONE OF THE

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.677
SURVIVING ROOMMATE'S CELL
PHONES.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:13.346
POLICE ALSO SAYING FOR THE FIRST
TIME THAT THERE WERE SEVERAL

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:18.518
OTHER FRIENDS AT THE HOUSE WHEN
THAT 9-1-1 CALL CAME IN, WHICH

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:21.354
OF COURSE WAS HOURS AFTER THE
ACTUAL MURDERS THEMSELVES.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:25.992
NOW, DESPITE THE DETAILS, POLICE
TONIGHT STILL HAVE NO SUSPECT,

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:35.468
NO WEAPON, NO MOTIVE.
&gt;&gt; THIS INCIDENT HAS SHAKEN OUR

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.170
COMMUNITY.
AND WE CONTINUE TO MOURN FOR THE

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.204
VICTIMS.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: MORE THAN A WEEK

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:42.575
AFTER THE KILLINGS OF FOUR
UNIVERSITY OF IDAHO STUDENTS,

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:45.612
THE MYSTERY OVER WHO MURDERED
THEM ONLY DEEPENS.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:49.282
AS INVESTIGATORS SEARCH THE
CRIME SCENE, POLICE REVEALING

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:53.553
WHO IS NOT CONSIDERED A SUSPECT.
BEGINNING WITH THE TWO ROOMMATES

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:57.457
ASLEEP IN THE HOME AS FOUR
OTHERS WERE STABBED TO DEATH.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:00.627
&gt;&gt; HOW DOES ONE INDIVIDUAL KILL
FOUR PEOPLE AT NIGHT AND NOT

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:04.164
WAKE UP THE OTHER TWO ROOMMATES?
&gt;&gt; I DON'T EVEN KNOW THAT

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:05.165
INFORMATION AT THIS POINT IN
TIME.

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:07.066
AND THAT'S WHY WE'RE CONTINUING
TO INVESTIGATE.

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:10.703
&gt;&gt; Reporter: BUT POLICE ABLE TO
CLEAR THE ROOMMATES AS SUSPECTS,

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:14.374
ADDING THAT ONE OF THEIR PHONES
WAS USED TO PLACE THE 9-1-1 CALL

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:19.111
JUST BEFORE NOON THAT DAY.
THE INITIAL CALLER NOT REVEALED,

00:01:19.111 --> 00:01:22.815
AND POLICE SAY SEVERAL PEOPLE
TALKED TO THE DISPATCHER.

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:26.986
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS OTHER FRIENDS THAT
HAD ARRIVED AT THE LOCATION.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.355
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THOSE FRIENDS FIRST
CALLED OVER BY THE ROOMMATES

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:33.026
WHEN THEY THOUGHT ONE OF THE
VICTIMS WAS PASSED OUT AND NOT

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:39.065
WAKING UP.
ALSO CLEARED AS A SUSPECT, A MAN

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:44.804
KAYLEE GONCALVES CALLED SEVERAL
TIMES.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:47.740
HER FAMILY SAY IT'S WAS AN
EX-BOYFRIEND AND THAT THEY NEVER

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.076
SUSPECTED HIM.
&gt;&gt; HE IS NOT A SUSPECT.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:55.548
HE IS NOT SUSPICIOUS.
HE IS 100% INNOCENT IN THIS.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:58.618
&gt;&gt; Reporter: POLICE ALSO CLEARED
AS A SUSPECT SOMEONE SEEN IN

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:01.821
VIDEO FROM A FOOD TRUCK THAT TWO
OF THE VICTIMS VISITED THAT

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:06.759
NIGHT.
AND A DRIVER THAT PICKED UP

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:10.964
GONCALVES AND MADISON MOGEN WHO
PICKED THEM UP AFTER.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:15.068
THE MURDER WEAPON, WE KNOW, IS A
FIXED-BLADE KNIFE, GENERALLY

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:18.705
MUCH STRONGER THAN A KITCHEN
KNIFE, AND COMMONLY USED IN

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:20.773
HUNTING.
POLICE SAY ALL FOUR VICTIMS WERE

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:24.277
LIKELY SLEEPING AT THE TIME OF
THE ATTACK.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:28.214
BUT SOME POSSIBLY WOKE UP AND
DEFENDED THEMSELVES.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:33.686
&gt;&gt; THERE WERE STAB WOUNDS ON THE
HANDS OF AT LEAST ONE OF THE

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:36.889
STUDENTS THAT MAKE IT APPEAR
THAT IT WOULD BE DEFENSIVE

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:38.524
WOUNDS.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: AUTHORITIES

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:41.027
CANVASSING NEIGHBORHOODS FOR
CLUES AND ADDITIONAL VIDEO AS

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:45.665
FLYERS READING "PLEASE HELP"
APPEARED AROUND THE

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:48.034
NEIGHBORHOOD.
KAYLEE'S MOTHER TELLING NBC

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:51.404
SHE'S URGING THE KILLER TO END
THE MYSTERY.

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:53.806
&gt;&gt; THE GUILT HAS GOT TO BE JUST
OVERWHELMING.

00:02:53.806 --> 00:03:00.079
IT'S GOT TO BE SICKENING.
STOP HIDING, STOP RUNNING.

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:03.983
&gt;&gt; Reporter: AND ALL OF THESE
FAMILIES WANT TO FIND THE

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:05.618
KILLER.
THEY WANT ANSWERS, THEY WANT

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:07.720
JUSTICE.
BUT IN THE MEANTIME THEY'RE ALSO

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:12.458
PLANNING FUNERALS.
ETHAN CHAPIN'S FUNERAL IS

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:15.495
HAPPENING AS WE SPEAK.
CAMERAS WERE NOT ALLOWED INSIDE

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:18.231
OF THE SERVICE.
BUT HIS MOTHER SPOKE BEFORE THAT

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:19.799
SERVICE.
SHE WAS EXTREMELY EMOTIONAL,

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:22.068
SAYING THAT HER SON IS ONE OF
THE MOST INCREDIBLE PEOPLE

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:24.737
YOU'LL EVER MEET.
THEY ASKED EVERYONE TO WEAR BLUE

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:27.874
BECAUSE HE IS A TRIPLET, AND
THAT IS HIS FAVORITE COLOR.

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:32.578
JOINING ME IS HOST OF HLN'S REAL
LIFE NIGHTMARE.

00:03:32.578 --> 00:03:35.281
GREAT TO SEE YOU.
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF THIS CASE SO

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:38.051
FAR, PARTICULARLY WHAT SEEMS TO
BE THE SCARCITY OF INFORMATION

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:40.253
OR AT LEAST LACK OF PUBLICLY
RELEASED INFORMATION.

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:41.954
DO YOU THINK THAT MAYBE
AUTHORITIES KNOW MORE THAN

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:45.958
THEY'RE REVEALING?
&gt;&gt; WELL, THERE'S NO QUESTION

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:48.494
THAT AUTHORITIES KNOW MORE THAN
WHAT THEY'RE REVEALING BUT I

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:53.132
THINK AS I'M WATCHING THIS CASE,
AND WATCH IT UNFOLD, I THINK

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:56.035
AUTHORITIES ARE STILL TRYING TO
FIGURE OUT EXACTLY WHAT THEY'RE

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:58.638
DEALING WITH.
YOU KNOW, INITIALLY THEY CAME

00:03:58.638 --> 00:04:02.041
OUT AND SAID THIS APPEARS TO BE
A TARGETED ATTACK.

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:04.177
THERE'S NO CONCERN TO THE REST
OF THE PUBLIC.

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:09.615
BUT THEN SINCE THEN, THEY HAVE
RETRACTED THAT, AND I BELIEVE AS

00:04:09.615 --> 00:04:12.852
THEY INVESTIGATE THIS CASE,
THEY'RE STARTING TO REALIZE IT'S

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:15.722
MAYBE MORE COMPLICATED THAN WHAT
THEY FIRST THOUGHT.

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:19.625
&gt;&gt; HOW SO?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I BELIEVE WHAT'S

00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:22.295
HAPPENING IS THAT YOU HAVE FOUR
VICTIMS.

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.130
AND THIS IS OBVIOUSLY A HUGE
CASE.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:27.800
IT'S VERY COMPLICATED.
AND WHEN THEY WENT INTO THIS

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:32.739
CRIME SCENE, THEY LIKELY SAW
THAT MAYBE ONE OR TWO OF THE

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:35.341
VICTIMS HAD MORE VIOLENCE
INFLICTED ON THEM.

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:38.711
THE OFFENDER SPENT MORE TIME
WITH THEM, AND THEY THOUGHT,

00:04:38.711 --> 00:04:42.215
OKAY, THESE WERE THE INTENDED
TARGETS, AND THAT THE OTHER

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:44.383
VICTIMS IN THE HOUSE WERE
SECONDARY.

00:04:44.383 --> 00:04:47.720
SO THEY FOCUSED THEIR INITIAL
INVESTIGATION THINKING, OKAY,

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:52.825
IT'S GOING TO BE SOMETHING, A
RELATIONSHIP, SOME SORT OF PRIOR

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:56.729
INTERACTION THAT THE OFFENDER
HAD WITH THOSE PARTICULAR

00:04:56.729 --> 00:04:59.398
VICTIMS.
HOWEVER, WHEN THAT DIDN'T PAN

00:04:59.398 --> 00:05:04.637
OUT, NOW I THINK WHAT THEY'RE
UNDERSTANDING IS THERE'S A

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:08.441
POSSIBILITY THAT THE OFFENDER,
THE KILLER, IS A COMPLETE

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:10.910
STRANGER TO THESE VICTIMS AND
THAT THE REASON THAT THEY'RE

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:14.013
SEEING THAT SOME OF THE VICTIMS
HAD MORE VIOLENCE ON THEM WAS

00:05:14.013 --> 00:05:16.949
DUE TO THE CIRCUMSTANCES AS THE
VIOLENCE WAS BEING INFLICTED.

00:05:16.949 --> 00:05:19.419
&gt;&gt; THE DETAILS WE MENTIONED
ABOUT THE HOURS LEADING UP TO

00:05:19.419 --> 00:05:23.756
THE MURDERS, HOW CRUCIAL IS THE
TIME LINE, AND MAYBE HOW FAR

00:05:23.756 --> 00:05:27.026
WOULD YOU GO BACK LOOKING?
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU KNOW, THE TIME LINE

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:31.364
IS ABSOLUTELY CRUCIAL.
IT'S POSSIBLE THAT THAT NIGHT,

00:05:31.364 --> 00:05:35.334
WHILE THE VICTIMS ARE OUT, YOU
KNOW, ENJOYING THEIR COLLEGE

00:05:35.334 --> 00:05:38.471
YEARS THAT THE OFFENDER COULD
HAVE INTERACTED WITH THEM OR

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:40.940
HAVE SEEN THEM AND FOLLOWED THEM
BACK.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:45.545
SO THAT IS ABSOLUTELY MANDATED
TO FOLLOW UP ON.

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:49.882
HOWEVER, RIGHT NOW THEY'VE ONLY
RELEASED INFORMATION OF THE

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:53.352
VICTIMS' TIME LINES FOR THAT
EVENING, AND OFTENTIMES KILLERS

00:05:53.352 --> 00:05:58.658
MAKE THE DECISION TO KILL WITHIN
72 HOURS, THREE DAYS BEFORE THE

00:05:58.658 --> 00:06:01.794
ATTACK.
SO THEY NEED TO GO BACK AND

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:06.165
ACTUALLY FIGURE OUT, WELL,
WHAT'S BEEN GOING ON IN THESE

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:08.835
VICTIMS' LIVES THREE DAYS PRIOR
TO THIS ATTACK IF NOT FURTHER.

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:12.839
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE ABOUT 30 SECONDS
LEFT, CAN YOU WRAP YOUR HEAD

00:06:12.839 --> 00:06:16.309
AROUND THE FACT THAT THERE WERE
TWO OTHER ROOMMATES WHO SEEM TO

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:19.479
HAVE SLEPT THROUGH THE MURDERS
AND WERE NOT ATTACKED?

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:27.587
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, FROM AFAR, YOU HAVE
SIX PEOPLE INSIDE THIS HOUSE.

00:06:27.587 --> 00:06:28.788
FOUR ARE KILLED.
FOR ME, WHERE ARE THESE VICTIMS

00:06:28.788 --> 00:06:33.292
INSIDE THE HOUSE.
THESE TWO ROOMMATES MAY HAVE

00:06:33.292 --> 00:06:35.728
BEEN MORE ISOLATED THAN THE
OTHER VICTIMS WERE.

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:38.297
THAT'S WHY THEY WERE SPARED OR
THEY WEREN'T THE TARGET OF THIS

00:06:38.297 --> 00:06:43.736
PARTICULAR OFFENDER.
&gt;&gt; PAUL HOLZ, WE APPRECIATE YOUR

00:06:43.736 --> 00:06:46.572
TIME HELPING US TO UNDERSTAND
WHICH AT THIS POINT IS STILL A

00:06:46.572 --> 00:06:48.241
REALLY BIG MYSTERY.

